anes-de-gaia/commit/b39833fa8d62f43eaec9cdc2b6d1a11304bc860f"}]}, {"sha": "3e1b65f31ed79098522c0736e70ca828f195b184", "node_id": "C_kwDOPIVmINoAKDNlMWI2NWYzMWVkNzkwOTg1MjJjMDczNmU3MGNhODI4ZjE5NWIxODQ", "commit": {"author": {"name": "balejosg", "email": "ecomovequest@gmail.com", "date": "2025-07-17T18:24:19Z"}, "committer": {"name": "balejosg", "email": "ecomovequest@gmail.com", "date": "2025-07-17T18:24:19Z"}, "message": "feat: Deploy enterprise-grade CI/CD system to GitHub\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Complete CI/CD System Implementation:\n\n## \ud83d\udd27 Core CI/CD Components\n- \u2705 Backend CI Pipeline (Java/Spring Boot with Maven)\n- \u2705 Mobile CI Pipeline (Flutter cross-platform)\n- \u2705 Docker Build & Push workflows\n- \u2705 Docker Compose stack testing\n\n## \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Security & Quality Gates\n- \u2705 Multi-layer security scanning (CodeQL, Trivy, Semgrep)\n- \u2705 OWASP dependency checking\n- \u2705 Code quality gates (SonarQube, SpotBugs)\n- \u2705 License compliance checking\n- \u2705 Mobile security analysis\n\n## \ud83d\ude80 Advanced Deployment Strategies\n- \u2705 Blue-green deployments\n- \u2705 Canary releases with traffic splitting\n- \u2705 A/B testing capabilities\n- \u2705 Multi-environment deployment automation\n- \u2705 Environment promotion workflows\n- \u2705 Automated rollback mechanisms\n\n## \u2693 Infrastructure as Code\n- \u2705 Complete Helm charts for Kubernetes\n- \u2705 Environment-specific configurations\n- \u2705 Security policies and network policies\n- \u2705 Monitoring integration\n\n## \ud83d\udcf1 Mobile App Store Deployment\n- \u2705 Google Play Store automation\n- \u2705 Apple App Store deployment\n- \u2705 Fastlane integration\n- \u2705 Release management\n\n## \ud83d\udcca Monitoring & Observability\n- \u2705 Prometheus metrics collection\n- \u2705 Grafana dashboards\n- \u2705 Alert rules and notifications\n- \u2705 Business metrics tracking\n\n## \ud83c\udfaf Key Features\n- 11 comprehensive GitHub Actions workflows\n- Enterprise-grade security scanning\n- Multi-environment deployment pipeline\n- Complete mobile app store automation\n- Advanced deployment strategies\n- Infrastructure as Code with Helm\n- Comprehensive monitoring and observability\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>", "tree": {"sha": "fccb6f75560d83d7334de0a85fb96a4ac3284041", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/balejosg/guardianes-de-gaia/git/trees/fccb6f75560d83d7334de0a85fb96a4ac3284041"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/balejosg/guardianes-de-gaia/git/commits/3e1b65f31ed79098522c0736e70ca828f195b184", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/balejosg/guardianes-de-gaia/commits/3e1b65f31ed79098522c0736e70ca828f195b184", "html_url": "https://github.com/balejosg/guardianes-de-gaia/commit/3e1b65f31ed79098522c0736e70ca828f195b184", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/balejosg/guardianes-de-gaia/commits/3e1b65f31ed79098522c0736e70ca828f195b184/comments", "author": {"login": "balejosg", "id": 89631734, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg5NjMxNzM0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89631734?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/balejosg", "html_url": "https://github.com/balejosg", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/balejosg/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/balejosg/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/balejosg/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/balejosg/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/balejosg/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/balejosg/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/balejosg/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/balejosg/events{/privacy}", "received_